{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108964","id":2694376176,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gmOrw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108964","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108964.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108964.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108964","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108964/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108964/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108964/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/39fba218bdb31174558eeac972185547d3c00b5d","number":108964,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix: Make `get_space_left` on Windows use `current_dir` instead of process CWD","user":{"login":"moluopro","id":55039286,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDM5Mjg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55039286?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro","html_url":"https://github.com/moluopro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes a behavioral inconsistency in `DirAccessWindows::get_space_left()`, where the method incorrectly queries the available disk space of the process's current working directory (CWD) instead of the directory tracked by the DirAccess instance via current_dir, as is correctly done on Unix platforms.\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nThe original Windows implementation uses:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nGetDiskFreeSpaceEx(nullptr, ...)\r\n```\r\n\r\nPassing `nullptr` causes the API to use the **current process directory**, not the directory path that the `DirAccess` object is logically operating on.\r\n\r\nThis leads to incorrect results in the following cases:\r\n\r\n- When the process is running on drive `D:` but the `DirAccess` object has opened a path on drive `C:`.\r\n- When calling `change_dir()` on a `DirAccess` object, which updates `current_dir`, but `get_space_left()` continues to use the wrong drive.\r\n\r\nThis results in behavioral inconsistency between platforms.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108966","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archi